cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use uxlearn in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "uxlearn: An R Package for Learning User Experience"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-01
authors:
  - family-names: "Sánchez-Núñez"
    given-names: "Pablo"
    email: psancheznunez@outlook.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7845-9506"
url: "https://pablosancheznunez.com/uxlearn/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pablosancheznunez/uxlearn"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  uxlearn is an open R package for teaching and learning user experience (UX)
  evaluation: usability metrics, analysis of usability studies, reproducible
  simulations of synthetic UX data, case studies, and a workbook. The package
  is released under the MIT License and the learning materials under CC BY 4.0.
keywords:
  - user experience
  - usability
  - UX research
  - education
  - open educational resources
  - R
